  "_audioWordSwapComment": "Rule for every kerbal sound event: a stock event whose name contains `from` plays through the mod event with the same name and `to` instead (Play_An_Kerbal_footsteps -> Play_An_Gerbal_footsteps, Play_AnVo_kerbal_yawn -> Play_AnVo_gerbal_yawn), provided a bank in assets/soundbanks defines that event; otherwise the stock sound plays. stockAudioEvents lists the known stock names (the id-based PostEvent overloads only carry hashes, so the rule needs names to pre-compute the id table); names that arrive as strings are handled live even when unlisted.",
